# E4-R24: throwaway fixtures spawned by the final-result protocol test live in
# apps/cli/src for ONE vitest subprocess run (never committed, never seen by
# git status --porcelain). They must stay invisible to the working-tree
# fingerprint so a concurrent promotion benchmark (e4-09) never sees a dirty
# tree and refuses to run — the fixture dirt would be a false positive, not a
# real source change.
apps/cli/src/e4-r24-fixture-*.test.ts

